			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Maybe a `/random/index.html` file with a bit of JS to dynamically set a  meta http-equiv refresh tag? 🤔</p>",
